      "text": {
        "en": "Clients consistently praise Matty for helping dogs overcome severe fear, barrier aggression, and urban noise triggers. Reviewers note that nervous rescues and adolescent dogs build genuine confidence and learn coping skills, transforming stressful outings into manageable daily strolls."
      }
