      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Owners describe Matty as an exceptionally patient, knowledgeable, and compassionate trainer who takes a thorough history of each pet. Clients appreciate that she listens without judgment, sets realistic expectations, and tailors practical exercise plans to family routines."
      }
    },
